# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   S. J. Magorrian et al. (2025). Strong atomic reconstruction in twisted bilayers of highly flexible InSe: Machine-learned interatomic potential and continuum model approaches.
#   Physical Review Materials. doi:10.1103/physrevmaterials.9.014004  arXiv:2406.19462v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2406.19462v1 (sha256 41c0d98fece57c55...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
