#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/magorrian2025.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the single-purpose MACE potential for InSe trained on
# 666 optB88-vdW configurations (strained primitive and MD-displaced 6x6
# monolayers, 572 rigidly shifted primitive bilayers, large-angle
# twisted bilayers) with the stated training and validation RMSEs; the
# MACE-MP-0 model used only to generate MD snapshots is not a trained
# model of this paper. Reconstruction patterns and the continuum model
# are not metrics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
